sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Annotator
  participant F as Slot form
  participant R as Save route
  participant D as Database
  A->>F: save C (event type)
  F->>R: POST C slots
  R->>R: deriveOutcome(C, stored O)
  R->>D: save_slot_answers(C, Prev, O if derivable)
  D->>D: validate_slots + validate_outcome_slots
  A->>F: tick signs on O (collision)
  F->>F: outcomeState: level = max(sign level)
  F->>R: POST O slots
  R->>R: deriveOutcome(C, submitted)
  R->>D: save_slot_answers(O.v2)
  A->>R: complete video
  R->>D: refuse if O.v2 contradicts C
